#ASSERT `s 60 the provision is repealed` `s 60(3) section 11 of the Welfare Reform Act 2009` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 60 the provision is repealed` `s 60(3) Schedule 3 to the Welfare Reform Act 2009` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 60 the provision is repealed` `s 60 some other provision` EQUALS NOTHING

